"""Inline SVG icons for the web portal, replacing the Material Symbols font.

The font came from Google Fonts on every page load: on slow campus Wi-Fi the
rail showed its ligature words ("dashboard", "school") until it arrived, and
it was one more third-party request. These are Lucide icons (ISC licence,
lucide-static 1.61.0), inlined, so they render with the page.

Templates call icon('name', 'h-5 w-5') with the Material name they already
used. An unknown name raises, so a typo fails the render check
(tests/render_check.py) instead of rendering blank. GENERATED from the
lucide-static package by the mapping below; to add one, add a pair and copy
its SVG body from lucide.dev/icons.
"""

